  ### 5. DAG Execution Strategy

  #### 5.1 DAG 总览

  ```mermaid
  flowchart TD
      N1[Node 01: B1 Markdown Wiring Repair] --> N4[Node 04: Integration Wiring]
      N2[Node 02: B2 Dataset Parse Repair] --> N4
      N3[Node 03: B3 Dataset Contract Block Repair] --> N4
      N4 --> N5[Node 05: Targeted Tests]
      N5 --> N6[Node 06: Bypass + Smoke Verification]
      N6 --> N7[Node 07: Post-Repair Reality Review]
  ```

  #### 5.2 Node 01 — B1 Markdown Wiring Repair

  ```yaml
  node_id: node-01-b1-markdown-wiring
  owner: Codex / Claude Code
  input:
    - src/phase4/report_agent.py
    - src/phase4/report_narrative.py
    - main_new.py
    - tools/run_pipeline_new.py
  goal: >
    让新路径 generate_report_with_llm_narrative 返回的 markdown 被 save_markdown_report 显式消费，避免走
  _llm_generated_markdown 全局变量 fallback。
  allowed_changes:
    - save_markdown_report 增加 markdown: Optional[str] = None 参数
    - 当 markdown 参数存在且长度 > 100 时优先使用 markdown
    - main_new.py / tools/run_pipeline_new.py 显式传入 markdown
  forbidden:
    - 不改 REPORT_SYSTEM_PROMPT
    - 不改 markdown normalizer 语义
    - 不删除 _llm_generated_markdown 旧路径兼容
  expected_outputs:
    - targeted test: new path markdown is passed into save_markdown_report
  ```

  推荐实现方向：

  ```python
  save_markdown_report(
      phase4_output,
      extraction_output,
      output_path=None,
      *,
      markdown: str | None = None,
  )
  ```

  优先级：

  ```text
  1. 显式 markdown 参数
  2. 旧路径 _llm_generated_markdown
  3. code-owned fallback generate_markdown_report
  ```

